    m_Localized: Beyond the Horizon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931656
    m_Localized: He rides the current off the island on his own raft.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931657
    m_Localized: The sea may be a road, not a wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931658
    m_Localized: Where There's Smoke
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931659
    m_Localized: The smoke he tended finally draws a ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931660
    m_Localized: Make a day visible from far away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931661
    m_Localized: Kim Calling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931662
    m_Localized: One clear sentence puts him back on the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931663
    m_Localized: Static becomes a sentence if you listen long enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931664
    m_Localized: One Good Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931665
    m_Localized: He fires his only flare at the right moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931666
    m_Localized: Save the shot until the opportunity arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931667
    m_Localized: The Light on the Ridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931668
    m_Localized: The restored relay makes the island visible again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931669
    m_Localized: Wake the dead light at the highest point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931670
    m_Localized: Coconut Navy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417803931671
    m_Localized: The coconut cargo becomes famous before the raft.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125952
    m_Localized: Every boat needs ballast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125953
    m_Localized: Island Barbecue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125954
    m_Localized: Rescuers follow rumors of legendary barbecue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125955
    m_Localized: A rescue signal can look a little too delicious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125956
    m_Localized: Island FM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125957
    m_Localized: Songs between distress calls gain listeners.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125958
    m_Localized: If nobody answers, try broadcasting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125959
    m_Localized: Fireworks at Noon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125960
    m_Localized: A curious boat follows what looks like a celebration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125961
    m_Localized: Even bad timing can find a witness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125962
    m_Localized: The Brightest Address
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125963
    m_Localized: The relay becomes a shipping landmark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125964
    m_Localized: Try a little more light than necessary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125965
    m_Localized: The Sea Made a Road
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125966
    m_Localized: He catches a current learned through countless swims.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125967
    m_Localized: The sea speaks when you travel the same water long enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125968
    m_Localized: SOS in the Clouds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125969
    m_Localized: Smoke draws a perfect distress sign beneath the clouds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125970
    m_Localized: Entrust a sentence to the wind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125971
    m_Localized: 'Forecast: Rescue'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125972
    m_Localized: A weather network calculates a rescue route between storms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125973
    m_Localized: Old records may still have listening ears.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125974
    m_Localized: Inside the Eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125975
    m_Localized: He lights the relay inside the storm's calm eye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125976
    m_Localized: Every preparation answers on the fiercest day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125977
    m_Localized: Kim Farm, Day 50
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125978
    m_Localized: His farm grows large enough to need a calendar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125979
    m_Localized: When planting plans outnumber departure plans.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125980
    m_Localized: Island Facilities Office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125981
    m_Localized: Checklists become scarier than storms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125982
    m_Localized: Even an island can become a managed district.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125983
    m_Localized: Doctor of Driftwood Engineering
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125984
    m_Localized: He proves that no piece of salvage is useless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125985
    m_Localized: Study every found object to the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125986
    m_Localized: Island Ranger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125987
    m_Localized: He learns every current and animal trail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125988
    m_Localized: Learn the island's paths before people return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125989
    m_Localized: Mr. Kim, Doing Fine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125990
    m_Localized: He masters no single lifestyle but survives in his own way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 747417808125991
    m_Localized: You do not need to master only one thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
